# The build context is sent to the daemon in full on every build, and the
# breakout-agent Dockerfile then COPYs apps/breakout-agent/ wholesale into the
# image. Without this file that meant 4.4 GB of context per build and a
# 4.72 GB dashboard image, almost all of it study-cache — forty years of daily
# bars for 5,485 symbols that only the offline study scripts in src/scripts/
# ever read, and nothing at runtime touches.
#
# That is why deploy.sh has to prune images before every build to stop the
# droplet's disk filling.
apps/breakout-agent/study-cache/
apps/trading-agent/study-cache/

# Installed inside the image by `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Built inside the image by `pnpm -F breakout-agent build`.
apps/breakout-agent/dist/
apps/trading-agent/dist/

# Never needed to run the app.
.git/
.github/
docs/
*.md
!apps/breakout-agent/**/*.md
.claude/
.env
.env.*
!.env.tiers/
test-results/
playwright-report/
*.log
.DS_Store
